  "notes": [
    "Caliptra v2.1.2; selected sha256_ctrl only. Every physical width/direction extracted from actual Verilator JSON.",
    "Both reset_n and cptra_pwrgood must be low during initialization. cptra_pwrgood drives generated error_reset_b, not ordinary constant configuration.",
    "debugUnlock_or_scan_mode_switch fixed zero. Error/notification pins passive only.",
    "Only aligned full-word single outstanding accesses. No slave byte enables; do not emulate partial writes with read-modify-write.",
    "sha256_ctrl ties ahb_slv_sif err=0/hld=0; internal sha256_err is not connected to bus response. Invalid offsets need not produce HRESP.",
    "Static closure only; no register/algorithm transaction acceptance or runtime admission."
  ],
